"native manual trigger. Requires the latest post-workflow hash. Can change "
"content, send messages or schedule steps; execution is not reversible or "
"idempotent. Dispatch does not guarantee all downstream steps completed. "
"dry_run checks eligibility without triggering anything."
msgstr ""
